        <mxCell id="notas" value="A &#39;Reserved subnet&#39; está vazia igual à do modelo recusado — e aqui o motor desenha assim mesmo. A assimetria é a decisão do #22: a grade EXIGE o fato porque lá a ordem das linhas é o desenho; o ELK avisa, porque lá a camada só desempata irmãos que nenhuma aresta ordena." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8E1;strokeColor=#B7791F;fontColor=#6B4E00;fontFamily=Arial,Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="32" y="564" width="836" height="70" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <object id="panlabs-modelo" label="" panlabsEsquema="panlabs-aws-diagrams/modelo@1" panlabsModelo="{&quot;esquema&quot;:&quot;panlabs-aws-diagrams/modelo@1&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;elk-sem-camada&quot;,&quot;titulo&quot;:&quot;A mesma lacuna, no caminho do ELK — aqui ela avisa&quot;,&quot;subtitulo&quot;:&quot;Uma AZ só, então não há grade. A subnet sem camada não bloqueia: o ELK tem o grafo para ordenar, e o motor conta o que não soube.&quot;,&quot;vista&quot;:&quot;tecnica&quot;,&quot;genero&quot;:&quot;T1&quot;,&quot;nos&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;nuvem&quot;,&quot;tipo&quot;:&quot;nuvem&quot;,&quot;rotulo&quot;:&quot;AWS Cloud&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;regiao&quot;,&quot;tipo&quot;:&quot;regiao&quot;,&quot;rotulo&quot;:&quot;eu-west-1&quot;,&quot;dentro&quot;:&quot;nuvem&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;vpc&quot;,&quot;tipo&quot;:&quot;vpc&quot;,&quot;rotulo&quot;:&quot;VPC de produção · 10.80.0.0/16&quot;,&quot;cidr&quot;:&quot;10.80.0.0/16&quot;,&quot;dentro&quot;:&quot;regiao&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;app&quot;,&quot;tipo&quot;:&quot;subnet&quot;,&quot;rotulo&quot;:&quot;App subnet&quot;,&quot;acesso&quot;:&quot;privada&quot;,&quot;az&quot;:&quot;eu-west-1a&quot;,&quot;dentro&quot;:&quot;vpc&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;res&quot;,&quot;tipo&quot;:&quot;subnet&quot;,&quot;rotulo&quot;:&quot;Reserved subnet&quot;,&quot;acesso&quot;:&quot;privada&quot;,&quot;az&quot;:&quot;eu-west-1a&quot;,&quot;cidr&quot;:&quot;10.80.20.0/24&quot;,&quot;dentro&quot;:&quot;vpc&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;ecs&quot;,&quot;tipo&quot;:&quot;servico&quot;,&quot;servico&quot;:&quot;ecs&quot;,&quot;rotulo&quot;:&quot;API&quot;,&quot;dentro&quot;:&quot;app&quot;},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;vpce&quot;,&quot;tipo&quot;:&quot;servico&quot;,&quot;servico&quot;:&quot;endpoints&quot;,&quot;rotulo&quot;:&quot;VPC endpoint&quot;,&quot;dentro&quot;:&quot;app&quot;}],&quot;arestas&quot;:[{&quot;de&quot;:&quot;ecs&quot;,&quot;para&quot;:&quot;vpce&quot;,&quot;rotulo&quot;:&quot;https&quo